tp</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getRequest</span>();\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> required.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">some</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">role</span> =&gt;</span> user.<span class=\"hljs-property\">roles</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(role));\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Step 3</strong>: register it globally and apply it:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@Roles(Role.ADMIN)\n@Get('admin-only')\ngetAdminData() { ... }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Roles</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Role</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ADMIN</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;admin-only&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getAdminData</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { ... }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Beyond roles you can go <strong>permission-based</strong> (fine-grained) with the casl library: <code>ability.can(Action.Update, 'User')</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Note: the guard runs after the JWT guard — make sure the user object is attached to the request before RolesGuard executes.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3264-giai-thich-request-lifecycle-trong-nestjs-middleware-guards-interceptors-pipes-c","title":"Giải thích Request Lifecycle trong NestJS: Middleware → Guards → Interceptors → Pipes → Controller → Exception Filters."},{"url":"/q/3265-guards-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-implement-jwt-auth-guard","title":"Guards trong NestJS là gì? Cách implement JWT Auth Guard?"},{"url":"/q/3266-pipes-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-dung-validationpipe-voi-class-validator","title":"Pipes trong NestJS là gì? Cách dùng ValidationPipe với class-validator?"},{"url":"/q/3267-interceptors-trong-nestjs-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao-neu-cac-use-case-pho-bien","title":"Interceptors trong NestJS hoạt động như thế nào? Nêu các use-case phổ biến."},{"url":"/q/3268-exception-filters-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-tao-global-error-handler","title":"Exception Filters trong NestJS là gì? Cách tạo global error handler."},{"url":"/q/3276-custom-decorators-trong-nestjs-cach-tao-currentuser-roles-public","title":"Custom Decorators trong NestJS — cách tạo @CurrentUser, @Roles, @Public?"},{"url":"/q/3279-middleware-trong-nestjs-functional-vs-class-middleware-apply-theo-routes","title":"Middleware trong NestJS — functional vs class middleware, apply theo routes?"},{"url":"/q/3260-nestjs-la-gi-tai-sao-nen-dung-nestjs-thay-vi-express-thuan","title":"NestJS là gì? Tại sao nên dùng NestJS thay vì Express thuần?"}]}